# ==============================================================================
# Enterprise Knowledge Assistant — Docker Build Context Ignore (.dockerignore)
# Prevents host OS binaries (Windows node_modules, .venv), caches, secrets,
# and runtime artifacts from entering Linux Docker build contexts.
# ==============================================================================

# Version control & local secrets
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Frontend host dependencies & build outputs (avoid Windows native binaries in Alpine!)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# Python host virtual environments & caches
**/.venv
**/venv
**/ENV
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
**/*.egg-info

# Tests, documentation & local runtime data
tests
docs
backups
data/uploads
backend/data/uploads
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite3

# IDE & OS artifacts
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
